[D     dn="aa1" did="2026-09-11 14:28:30"     ]<br /><br />[S:406274]<br />{org:en}<br />The Hare and the Tortoise<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Lepus et testudo<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />and(hare(icl>leporid):73.@def,     tortoise(icl>turtle):92.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406275]<br />{org:en}<br />The Hare one day ridiculed the short feet and slow pace of the Tortoise.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Lepus olim breves pedes et tardum passum testudinis deridebat.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />agt(to ridicule(icl>mock):54.@past,     hare(icl>leporid):96.@def)<br />tim(to ridicule(icl>mock):54.@past,     one day:82)<br />cnt(to ridicule(icl>mock):54.@past,     :01.@def)<br />and:01(foot(icl>vertebrate foot):64.@pl,     pace(icl>step):5Y)<br />mod:01(pace(icl>step):5Y,     slow(equ>bumper-to-bumper):0J)<br />mod:01(foot(icl>vertebrate foot):64.@pl,     short(aoj>space):8S)<br />mod(:01.@def,     tortoise(icl>turtle):8H.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406276]<br />{org:en}<br />The Tortoise replied:<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Testudo respondit:<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />agt(reply:9G.@past,     tortoise(icl>turtle):9E.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406277]<br />{org:en}<br />"Though you be swift as the wind, I will beat you in a race."<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />"Cum sis celer sicut ventus, ego tamen te vincam spatio."<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />and(:02,     :01.@although)<br />agt:02(to beat(icl>vanquish):20.@future,     :3F.@1)<br />obj:02(to beat(icl>vanquish):20.@future,     :1K.@2)<br />lpl:02(to beat(icl>vanquish):20.@future,     race(cnt>speed):19.@indef)<br />aoj:01(fast(equ>accelerated):0H,     :1K.@2)<br />bas:01(fast(equ>accelerated):0H,     wind(icl>weather):9P.@def.@equal)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406278]<br />{org:en}<br />The Hare believed the assertion of the Tortoise to be simply impossible and assented to the proposal.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Lepus putavit adfirmationem suam impossibilem esse et consensit in conditionem.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />and(:01,     :02)<br />exp:01(to believe(icl>accept):3H.@past,     hare(icl>leporid):01.@def)<br />cnt:01(to believe(icl>accept):3H.@past,     :03)<br />aoj:03(impossible(equ>hopeless):29,     assertion(icl>declaration):1H.@def)<br />man:03(impossible:29,     simply:51)<br />agt:03(assertion:1H.@def,     tortoise:78.@def)<br />agt:02(to assent(icl>agree):0L.@past,     hare:02.@def)<br />cnt:02(to assent(icl>agree):0L.@past,     proposal(icl>content):42.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406279]<br />{org:en}<br />They agreed that the Fox should choose the course and fix the goal.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Condixerunt vulpem cursum optare et finem destituere.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />exp(agree.@past,     .@3.@pl)<br />obj(agree.@past,     :01)<br />agt:01(:02.@decision,     fox.@def)<br />and:02(choose,     fix)<br />cnt:02(choose,     course.@def)<br />cnt:02(fix,     goal.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406280]<br />{org:en}<br />On the day appointed for the race the Hare and the Tortoise started together.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Die delecta spatio, lepus et testudo simul inceperunt.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />agt(start.@past,     :01)<br />tim(start.@past,     :02)<br />and:01(hare.@def,     tortoise.@def)<br />man(start.@past,     together)<br />cnt:02(appoint.@past,     day.@def.@topic)<br />pur:02(appoint.@past,     race.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406281]<br />{org:en}<br />The Tortoise did not stop.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Testudo non destitit.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />agt(stop.@past.@not,     tortoise.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406282]<br />{org:en}<br />The Tortoise went on with a slow but steady pace straight to the end of the course.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Ea mansit tardo sed aequabili passu ad finem cursus.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />agt(go on.@past,     tortoise.@def)<br />met(go on.@past,     pace.@indef.@with)<br />man(go on.@past,     straight)<br />plt(go on.@past,     end.@def)<br />mod(end.@def,     course.@def)<br />mod(pace.@indef.@with,     :01)<br />and:01(slow,     steady.@but)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406283]<br />{org:en}<br />The Hare laid down by the wayside and took a nap under a tree.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Lepus se deposuit iuxta itinerem et conquievit sub arbore.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />and:01(lay down.@past,     take a nap.@past)<br />agt(:01.@past,     hare.@def)<br />plc:01(lay down.@past,     wayside.@def.@by)<br />plc:01(take a nap.@past,     tree.@indef.@under)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406284]<br />{org:en}<br />At last, the Hare woke up and ran as fast as he could, but it was too late.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Tandem, lepus ortus est et cucurrit quam celerrime, sed fuit nimis tarde.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />and(:01,     :02)<br />and(:02,     :03.@but)<br />exp:01(wake up.@past,     hare.@def)<br />man:01(wake up.@past,     at last)<br />agt:02(run.@past,     hare.@def)<br />man:02(run.@past,     fast)<br />bas:02(fast,     :04.@equal)<br />aoj:03(late.@extra.@past,     )<br />agt:04(run.@ability,     hare.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406285]<br />{org:en}<br />The Tortoise had already won the race.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Testudo iam vicerat spatio.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />agt(win.@past.@perfect,     tortoise.@def)<br />cnt(win.@past.@perfect,     race.@def)<br />tim(win.@past.@perfect,     already)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406286]<br />{org:en}<br />Slow but steady progress wins the race.<br />{/org}<br />{la}<br />Tardus sed aequabilis progressus vincit spatium.<br />{/la}<br />{unl}<br />met(win,     progress)<br />cnt(win,     race)<br />mod(progress,     :01)<br />and:01(slow,     steady.@but)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[/D]</body>
